rolled halftone textures, upward data curves, connected conversion nodes, interface fragments and abstract data-flame geometry. Preserve only its graphic language. Do not copy any performer or exact room composition from it.\n\n<Audio 1> is directly reused as the complete 13.003-second master soundtrack. Preserve its original music, vocal recording, lyric order, timing, rhythm, pauses and ending without regeneration, rearrangement, repetition, omission, time-stretching or replacement.\n\nThe exact lyric sequence already contained in <Audio 1> is:\n\n<d>[Chinese] 三秒定胜负，首屏不眨眼。CTR一抬头，流量往上窜。从种草到成交，链路别断线。GMV在高喊：继续把火点！</d>\n\n\nsummary:\n\nCreate an original approximately 13-second live-action fashion music video in 16:9, synchronized from the first frame to the directly reused soundtrack from <Audio 1>.\n\nThe performer lip-syncs only to the existing source vocal. She does not generate a new singing voice. Each lyric phrase activates one matching performer action, one camera impulse and one spatial typography event.\n\nTransform the dark meeting room into an acid-lime marketing growth command room. Visual escalation follows one continuous causal chain:\n\nfirst-screen attention;\nCTR increase;\ntraffic acceleration;\nseeding-to-purchase conversion;\nGMV data ignition.\n\nUse premium live-action fashion photography fused with original high-energy editorial motion graphics. Do not copy an existing game interface, franchise menu, logo, character system or exact visual composition.\n\n\nretention_analysis:\n\n<Picture 1>: identity_and_wardrobe_reference — preserve the performer’s face, green double space buns, makeup, earrings, black technical outfit and platform boots.\n\n<Picture 2>: environment_reference — preserve the coherent meeting-room architecture, table direction, chair arrangement, presentation wall and lighting system.\n\n<Picture 3>: graphic_style_reference — preserve only its acid-lime hierarchy, typography weight, diagonal energy, data curves, connected nodes, halftone texture and print-registration character.\n\n<Audio 1>: directly_reused_complete_soundtrack — preserve the source audio signal, lyric sequence, vocal timing and natural ending.\n\n\ndetailed_description:\n\n[Shot 1] Begin immediately with a wide, slightly low-angle view of the growth command room from <Picture 2>. The performer from <Picture 1> stands at the near end of the long conference table, facing camera with a focused, challenging expression. Her complete body, neon-green double space buns, oversized black jacket and platform boots remain clearly readable.\n\nWhen <Audio 1> reaches <d>[Chinese] 三秒定胜负，首屏不眨眼。</d>, she lip-syncs only to the existing source vocal and raises three fingers toward camera. A large cold-white numeral 【3】 snaps into the left side of the room inside an acid-lime first-screen frame. On the next vocal accent, the exact phrase 【三秒定胜负，首屏不眨眼】 locks into one tilted black editorial panel behind the numeral.\n\nThe camera makes one fast, controlled forward push. Three restrained graphic pulses move across the frame while the performer keeps direct eye contact without blinking. Do not create a countdown containing additional numbers.\n\n\n[Shot 2] At the next meaningful musical transition, make one diagonal graphic match cut into a medium lateral tracking view.\n\nWhen <Audio 1> reaches <d>[Chinese] CTR一抬头，流量往上窜。</d>, the performer walks beside the conference table and sweeps one open hand upward. She lip-syncs precisely to the source vocal.\n\nThe previous phrase becomes non-readable before the new text appears. The exact uppercase letters 【CTR】 rise once behind her as the dominant typographic element. The remaining exact phrase 【一抬头，流量往上窜】 follows on one smaller connected panel.\n\nOne acid-lime data curve rises continuously from the table toward the upper-right corner. Small traffic particles accelerate along the same curve. The camera tilts upward once with the gesture; do not add a second unrelated camera movement.\n\n\n[Shot 3] On the following vocal accent, cut to a dynamic low-angle medium-wide view along the conference table.\n\nWhen <Audio 1> reaches <d>[Chinese] 从种草到成交，链路别断线。</d>, the performer steps onto the table in one physically continuous action and moves forward along its central axis. She lip-syncs to the existing vocal while touching four floating conversion nodes in sequence.\n\nThe nodes represent one continuous journey:\n\ncontent exposure;\ninterest;\npurchase intent;\ncompleted transaction.\n\nA single acid-lime line connects every node without breaking. The exact text 【从种草到成交，链路别断线】 appears once along the same continuous perspective path. Keep the full phrase readable and correctly ordered on one connected visual system.\n\nDo not generate shopping-platform logos, brand icons, product trademarks or unrelated dashboards.\n\n\n[Shot 4] When <Audio 1> reaches its final phrase <d>[Chinese] GMV在高喊：继续把火点！</d>, make one controlled push into a medium close view while preserving the performer’s face, hairstyle, makeup and jacket collar.\n\nShe turns directly toward camera, raises one hand sharply and lip-syncs only to the existing final vocal. The previous conversion phrase collapses into non-readable geometric fragments.\n\nThe exact uppercase letters 【GMV】 expand once on the blank presentation wall as the largest final typographic element. The exact remaining phrase 【在高喊：继续把火点！】 appears directly beneath it on one connected cold-white and black panel with an acid-lime offset edge.\n\nEstablished traffic particles and conversion lines converge behind the performer and form one abstract acid-lime data flame. The flame consists of charts, arrows, particles and layered graphic ribbons; it is not real fire and does not burn the room.\n\nOn the final source syllable, she closes her raised hand into one decisive fist and holds direct eye contact. Keep 【GMV】 and the complete final phrase readable through the natural ending of <Audio 1>. End immediately without adding another shot, lyric or musical extension.\n\n\noverall_visual_style:\n\nPremium original live-action fashion MV fused with sophisticated editorial motion graphics. Maintain realistic skin, hair inertia, textile behavior, body weight and coherent architecture.\n\nAcid-lime, ink black and cold white dominate. Hot magenta appears only as a restrained data-alert accent.\n\nUse strong diagonal composition, condensed typographic hierarchy, tactile cut-paper panels, controlled halftone, offset print edges, upward charts and connected conversion paths. Graphic elements must interact with the room’s perspective and the performer’s gestures rather than behave like ordinary subtitles.\n\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nDirectly reuse <Audio 1> as the complete master soundtrack. Do not regenerate, rearrange, extend or replace its music and vocals.\n\nThe performer only lip-syncs to the existing source vocal. Visible gestures, steps, graphic pulses and camera changes synchronize to the existing musical accents.\n\nDo not add another singer, spoken dialogue, crowd noise, office conversation, invented lyrics or replacement music.\n\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\n<Audio 1> is directly reused as the complete audience-only music and vocal track. Preserve its exact duration, lyric sequence, arrangement, vocal phrasing and ending.\n\n\ntypography_rules:\n\nOnly the following approved readable elements may appear, in this exact progression:\n\n【3】\n\n【三秒定胜负，首屏不眨眼】\n\n【CTR】\n\n【一抬头，流量往上窜】\n\n【从种草到成交，链路别断线】\n\n【GMV】\n\n【在高喊：继续把火点！】\n\nPreserve the uppercase Latin forms CTR and GMV exactly.\n\nEach text event begins only when its matching phrase is heard in <Audio 1>. A previous lyric must disappear or become non-readable before the next phrase becomes dominant.\n\nDo not add ordinary bottom subtitles, English translations, platform names, song title, singer name, decorative words, additional numbers, logos or watermark.\n\n\ncontinuity_constraints:\n\nKeep exactly one performer and one coherent growth command room.\n\nP